%% Behavior authority: distribution.md.
swimlane-beta TB
  accTitle: DinyD release and installation responsibilities
  accDescr: The release workflow publishes artifacts. The bootstrap installer installs the global executable. DinyD verifies downloaded archives before publishing a project runtime or replacing itself.

  subgraph release [GitHub Actions · dist]
    Build["build for native platforms<br/><small>triggered by a version tag</small>"]
    Publish["publish release artifacts<br/><small>archives · checksums · installers</small>"]
  end

  subgraph bootstrap [Bootstrap installer]
    Install["install dinyd<br/><small>• user bin · PATH<br/>• checksum verification varies by platform</small>"]
  end

  subgraph runtime [DinyD runtime]
    Acquire["download and verify<br/><small>full SHA-256 against the release sidecar</small>"]
    Cache["publish exact-version runtime<br/><small>visible in the cache only when complete</small>"]
    Update["replace the invoked executable<br/><small>Windows-capable replacement</small>"]
  end

  Build --> Publish
  Publish -->|initial install| Install
  Publish -->|project setup · self-update| Acquire
  Acquire -->|project runtime| Cache
  Acquire -->|self-update| Update

  classDef em fill:#173d25,stroke:#86efac
  class Acquire em
